From: jitLLM contributors
Subject: [PATCH] cuda: share sparse attention gathers across query tiles

Narrow backport of the sparse query-tile union and live counts from
llama.cpp PRs 28770 and 29298, MIT, merge dc9879cf66aeb5c2f7c38e9578e6a5f38c497865.
Keep the pinned MMA configuration/swizzle. Also enable the existing D512
eight-query case; all masks remain per query and KV remains F16.

--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/fattn-common.cuh
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/fattn-common.cuh
@@ -719,7 +719,7 @@
 }
 
